  ('ababb295-82ea-45ce-bd50-779f50b6e97d', '2026-10-02', 'revision',
   'HTS Revision 8 (2026)',
   'Verified tariff data now covers entries through May 27, 2026. No Chapter 99 duty rates changed. Section 232 duties on medium- and heavy-duty vehicle parts can now be reduced by a manufacturer''s offset approved by Commerce; estimates show the full rate.',
