  ('e1932bfd-ec3d-4ce2-879c-49e0f3962a32', '2026-10-02', 'revision',
   'HTS Revision 9 (2026)',
   'Verified tariff data now covers entries through June 7, 2026. From May 1, 2026, goods of Taiwan get the same deal rates as Japan, the EU and Korea: auto parts and wood furniture and cabinets are capped at 15% including the regular duty, and certified civil aircraft components are exempt from Section 232 metals duties.',
