  ('f3f3e890-bf2c-412b-923e-7015ce9ae982', '2026-10-02', 'revision',
   'HTS Revision 10 (2026)',
   'Verified tariff data now covers entries through June 30, 2026. From June 8, 2026, Section 232 metals duties are restructured: many machinery and A/C parts move to the lower 10–15% rates, mobile equipment like forklifts and earthmovers gets its own treatment, and the U.S.-content threshold drops from 95% to 85%.',
