  ('9c12d103-7647-4256-8885-c03a07a711f6', '2026-10-02', 'improvement',
   'Lower Section 232 rates for parts used to build agricultural and industrial equipment',
   'From June 8, 2026, steel, aluminum and copper parts used only to manufacture agricultural, industrial or mobile equipment pay 10% or 15% including the regular duty, instead of 25%.',
