   'From July 22, 2026, most products of Brazil pay an additional 25% on top of the regular duty and any other additional duties. Goods loaded before July 22 and entered by July 28 are exempt, as are goods paying Section 232 duties, and listed products, civil aircraft parts and pharmaceuticals.',
