  ('e443702c-3304-41bc-9cb5-17312609d20f', '2026-10-02', 'revision',
   'HTS Revision 13 (2026)',
   'Verified tariff data now covers entries through July 30, 2026. Section 122''s 10% duty ended at the close of July 23, 2026, and from July 24 new Section 301 duties of 10% or 12.5% apply to goods from 59 countries and the EU. For the EU, Japan, South Korea, Switzerland and Taiwan, the rate is a total including the regular duty.',
