  ('cc1cef2d-df93-4807-8878-1b3f0e25275e', '2026-10-03', 'revision',
   'HTS Revision 16 (2026)',
   'Verified tariff data now covers entries through August 23, 2026. From August 15, 2026, quartz surface products (slabs, countertops, tiles and similar) pay a Section 201 safeguard duty of 25% within the quarterly quota and 50% above it, unless from an exempt country.',
